  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"11a(i)\"><p><strong>11a(i)</strong></p><p></p>\n<p>29000 = <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\"></span><em>a</em>(52)<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{2}\"></span></p>\n<p><em>a</em> = 21.4 m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span></p>\n<p><em>a</em> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\approx\"></span> 21 m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span></p>\n<p>Calculated answer should be given to at least 3 s. f. in order to earn final mark.</p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"11a(ii)\"><p><strong>11a(ii)</strong></p><p><em></em></p>\n<p><em>v</em> = (21.4)(52) = 1112.8 m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></p>\n<p><em>p</em> = (5.0 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{4}\"></span> + 9.7 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{3}\"></span>)(1112.8) = </p>\n<p>6.64 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{7}\"></span> kg m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"11b\"><p><strong>11b</strong></p><p> </p>\n<p>\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_02\"><img alt=\"Source markscheme diagram 2\" src=\"asset:fig_02\"/></figure>\n</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Notes: Thrust must be longer than the sum of the two other forces.</p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"11c(i)\"><p><strong>11c(i)</strong></p><p><em></em></p>\n<p><em>F</em> = (5 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{4}\"></span> + 9.7 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{3}\"></span>)(21.4)</p>\n<p><em>F</em> = 1277580 N </p>\n<p><em>F</em> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\approx\"></span> 1.3 MN</p>\n<p>Calculated answer should be given to at least 3 s. f. in order to earn final mark.</p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"11c(ii)\"><p><strong>11c(ii)</strong></p><p></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F_{net}\"></span> = <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F_{engine}\"></span> - <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F_{grav}\"></span> - <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F_{air}\"></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F_{air}\"></span> = 2.1 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{6}\"></span> - 1.3 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{6}\"></span> - (5 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{4}\"></span> + 9.7 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{3}\"></span>)(9.81)</p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F_{air}\"></span> = 214343 N <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\approx\"></span> 2.1 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{5}\"></span> N</p>\n<p></p></section>"
